306 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 65 0 R
/T (The Traffic Signal Simulator demonstrates how a Circular Linked List, a Queue and a HashMap can be combined to model a real-life traffic junction. The Circular Linked List repeats the signal phases automatically, the Queue serves vehicles in the correct first-come-first-served order, and the HashMap gives quick access to the signal timings. It also shows basic integration between a frontend \(HTML, CSS, JavaScript\) and a Spring Boot backend through REST endpoints. The project is simple and easy to demonstrate, and it can be extended in the future with the features listed under Future Scope.)
/E (The Traffic Signal Simulator demonstrates how a Circular Linked List, a Queue and a HashMap can be combined to model a real-life traffic junction. The Circular Linked List repeats the signal phases automatically, the Queue serves vehicles in the correct first-come-first-served order, and the HashMap gives quick access to the signal timings. It also shows basic integration between a frontend \(HTML, CSS, JavaScript\) and a Spring Boot backend through REST endpoints. The project is simple and easy to demonstrate, and it can be extended in the future with the features listed under Future Scope.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
